  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 802.02 Permit Application Requirements",
  "priorExpiration": "1997-10-29",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 802.02 Permit Application Requirements. The applicant for a landfill permit shall prepare the application in accordance with:\n\n(a) Env-Sw 314 for a standard permit;\n\n(b) Env-Sw 313 for an emergency permit;\n\n(c) Env-Sw 312 for a research and development permit; and\n\n(d) Env-Sw 311 for a permit-by-notification.\n\nSource. #5172, eff 7-1-91; ss by #6535, INTERIM, eff 7-1-97, EXPIRES: 10-29-97; ss by #6619-B, eff 10-29-97; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 800); ss by #8459, eff 10-28-05 (formerly Env-Wm 2502.02); ss by #10597, eff 7-1-14; ss by #14156, eff 12-21-24",
